  "negative_assertions": [
    "Hoses have ZERO item_end rows — raw hose is not terminated (guards against inventing ends).",
    "Every end-fitting has exactly one hose end + one connection end (never two connection ends, never zero).",
    "bore is stored as the canonical dash number, so a 1/2\" hose (dash 8) and a 1/2\" fitting hose-end (dash 8) match automatically (R2).",
    "hose_family carries pressure class: R1/R2=braided, 4SP/4SH=spiral. No pressure_rating field is written on any fitting (R1 rule).",
    "NPT (the male NPT fitting) is connection_standard='npt', never merged with bspt — the taper-mismatch guard still holds.",
    "Camlock end -> connection_standard='camlock'; Flange end -> 'sae_flange'; TC -> 'tc_triclamp' — coupler interfaces are typed, not free text.",
    "Codes present in the source (H01214006, PH370-16) are kept verbatim; the un-coded rows get a generated, editable code."
